            "review_text": "NorthStar41355182231\n1 contribution\n0\nA Refined Japanese Dining Experience\nDec 2025 • Friends\nYUKIMI is a Japanese restaurant in Ho Chi Minh City with a calm and elegant atmosphere. The space is beautifully designed with a minimalist Japanese style, making it perfect for a quiet dinner or a special occasion.\n\nThe food is excellent, using fresh ingredients and premium imported seafood. Every dish is well-prepared, balanced, and full of flavor. Service is professional and attentive without being intrusive.\n\nHighly recommended for anyone looking for quality Japanese fine dining in Ho Chi Minh City.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 13, 2025",
